#Prepwise - A smart meal prepping solution for college students

##What is The Problem?

Young adults, particularly college students with busy schedules and limited time or cooking experience, may struggle to plan meals and prepare multiple dishes effectively. Choosing suitable recipes, coordinating meal prep time, and managing ingredients can become time consuming and difficult to organize.

Prepwise aims to reduce this problem by automating the cooking process and creating an efficient, coordinated cooking schedule for multiple meals.

“The most common barrier to food preparation was lack of time, reported by 36% of young adults.” 
44.9% of participants agreed or strongly agreed that time was a barrier to cooking, while 41.8% reported a lack of previous meal-planning education. 

